<p>
God of grace,
</p>

<p>
You stand and knock,<br>
not demanding that we come to you,<br>
asking only that we open our hearts<br>
that you may come to us.
</p>

<p>
Help me, likewise,<br>
to love others just as<br>
you have loved me —<br>
</p>

<p>
Where they are,<br>
and as they are,<br>
not how I want<br>
them to be.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


